nk most people would want to adjust it by a pixel at a time, rather than 0.01 of a pixel (I'm not \"most people\" but that's besides the point). Either way, I'm very grateful you took the time to look into this!\n\nOn a somewhat related note, I noticed that other containers such as GridContainer and HBoxContainer also have this issue. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4089564778/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090339729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117581#issuecomment-4090339729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117581","id":4090339729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zzaGR","user":{"login":"RgeditV1","id":63971812,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTcxODEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63971812?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1","html_url":"https://github.com/RgeditV1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RgeditV1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T13:59:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T13:59:03Z","body":"So u think isnt unnecesarry the chante in spin editor no?